msgstr "![Output of the previous code cell](/learning/images/modules/computer-science/quantum-teleportation/extracted-outputs/5a23a576-385b-4a7c-899d-67ef4bb0bfed-0.avif)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "**$Z$ Gate**: Adds a \"phase\" to a state (a prefactor, which in the cases of the Z eigenstates $|0\\rangle$ and $|1\\rangle$ either a 1, or -1, respectively). Single-qubit gate.\n"
msgstr "**$Z$ Gate**: 상태에 \"위상(phase)\"을 추가합니다(계수인데, Z 고유 상태 $|0\\rangle$과 $|1\\rangle$의 경우 각각 1 또는 -1이 됩니다). 단일 qubit Gate입니다.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"Z|0\\rangle = |0\\rangle,\\\\Z|1\\rangle=-|1\\rangle\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"Z|0\\rangle = |0\\rangle,\\\\Z|1\\rangle=-|1\\rangle\n"
"$$\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"Z=\\begin{pmatrix} 1 & 0 \\\\ 0 & -1 \\end{pmatrix}\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"Z=\\begin{pmatrix} 1 & 0 \\\\ 0 & -1 \\end{pmatrix}\n"
"$$\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "In Qiskit, creating a circuit with an $Z$ gate looks like this:\n"
msgstr "Qiskit에서 $Z$ Gate가 있는 Circuit을 생성하는 방법은 다음과 같습니다:\n"

